# Clear Glass gig file (clearglass.gig/1) — load it in Settings → Autofill → Gig, or in the gig panel.
format: clearglass.gig/1
platform: fiverr
title: I will set up Claude Code or AI coding tools to build your project
category: Programming & Tech
subcategory: AI Development
tags:
  - claude code
  - ai coding
  - cursor
  - ai assistant
  - prompt rules
description: >-
  Using AI to code, but it keeps drifting, forgetting your rules or breaking things? I set it up so
  it works the way a careful developer would.


  I direct an AI coder every day on a large project, with written rules it must follow: map the work
  before building, reuse what exists, prove every change with a test, and never fail silently. That
  setup is what I build for you.


  What you get:

  - A project rules file (CLAUDE.md or similar) written for your codebase

  - A short map of your project the AI reads first

  - A build plan in phases the AI can follow one at a time

  - Checks it runs before saying a change is done

  - A walkthrough of how to direct it well


  How it works: share your project and what you want the AI to build. I set it up, run one real task
  with it, and show you the result.


  Works with Claude Code, Cursor, and other AI coding tools.
