faq:
  - question: Which AI tools do you support?
    answer: Claude Code first, plus Cursor and similar tools that read project rules.
  - question: Do I need a paid AI plan?
    answer: Usually yes, for the AI tool itself. I will tell you what you need before you order.
  - question: Will it work on an existing project?
    answer: 'Yes. That is where it helps most: the AI learns your structure instead of guessing.'
requirements:
  - What is your project, and what do you want the AI to build or fix next?
  - Who will use it, and on what? (Windows, Mac, a server; one person or a team)
  - What must it always do, and what must it never do?
  - How will you check that it is done? (the test you will run, or what you will look at)
  - Please share any files, examples, access or data I need to start.
